\tag{fdip}
\title{An exact matter obstruction and a positive marginal}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{The two-cell operator has only #{4} connection backgrounds.
Its determinant and two local insertions determine a
reflection Gram matrix on the even positive half. The
connection marginal can then be tested separately with the
same geometric reflection.}

\transclude{fdip-00XW}
\transclude{fdip-00XX}
\transclude{fdip-00XY}
